"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"Votre soumission « %(title)s » à %(edition_title)s a bien été reçue. Sa référence est %(reference)s.\n"
"\n"
"Vous pouvez la modifier jusqu'à la clôture de l'appel (%(call_close)s) depuis votre espace : %(link)s"
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"Your submission “%(title)s” to %(edition_title)s has been received. Its reference is %(reference)s.\n"
"\n"
"You can change it until the call closes (%(call_close)s) from your space: %(link)s"

#: apps/submissions/templates/submission/email/received_subject.txt:1
